A. Commit message:
gve: set XDP redirect target only when it is available

B. Change summary:
This patch ensures that the netdev is only reported as a redirect target when XDP queues exist to forward traffic. It removes the default setting of NETDEV_XDP_ACT_NDO_XMIT and adds checks to set/clear the redirect target flag appropriately.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

D. Fixed Code:
